00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.290
Welcome back!

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.670
Ayukawa...

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:37.090
Since the park incident, Ayukawa
seems to be giving me the cold shoulder.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.560
I thought that... I'd better do something, or else...

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.530
Kazuya must've read my mind completely...

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:03.910
...and left me alone with Ayukawa.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:48.170
I'll never... let Ayukawa...

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:51.190
...let her leave me...

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.980
Ayukawa...

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:00.500
Say...

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.470
What?
Say...

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:09.000
I wish we could...
just go somewhere together.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.240
It was totally unexpected.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.170
I... I was... at that moment...

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.690
...blown away by what Ayukawa said.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:37.290
All right! Kazuya said that we
ought to wait for you at this station.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:39.930
O... Oh...

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:57.190
Just what are you trying to do?!

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:01.350
Oniichan, you should make up your mind!

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:03.400
Say what?!

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:12.180
Say... Oneechans...

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:17.110
Are you okay with the way things are now?

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:44.700
"Are you okay with the way things are now?"

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:57.780
The way things are now is not okay... no way!

00:22:58.060 --> 00:22:58.420
Oniichan!

00:22:58.420 --> 00:23:00.120
Kazuya!
Oniichan!

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.890
Looks like Kazuya will be living in our building!

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:10.500
What?!

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.060
They've decided to move in next door.
What?!

00:23:13.060 --> 00:23:13.150
What?!

00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:15.800
They said they'll be moving in right away!

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:17.410
Eeek!

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:21.500
Th... This kid... is moving in next door?!

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:25.570
Indeed... Nothing could be worse!

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.590
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:44.850
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:49.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:53.420
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.420 --> 00:24:01.300
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:10.800
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:18.610
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:27.290
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:37.000
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:45.370
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:49.710
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:54.050
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:58.350
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:02.690
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:07.510
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.020 --> 00:25:15.870
I'm... gonna be confident from now on!

00:25:15.870 --> 00:25:17.890
I won't let anybody call me wishy-washy!

00:25:18.330 --> 00:25:21.010
Ayukawa... tonight you are my little devil.

00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:23.110
You'll make me drunk with your love.

00:25:23.110 --> 00:25:26.550
Come now! Let's dance 'til the morning comes!

00:25:26.550 --> 00:25:30.840
Next time: "Dangerous Auto-Suggestion -
Kyosuke's Metamorphosis."
